      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think that it is good to let the animation override by hand sign etc. overwrite the motion of Humanoid and raise the hand.\nThis specification has high versatility and there is no need to set a new key, so compatibility with a system using Q and E as operation keys is also good.\nThe order of precedence is as follows.\nVR tracking> HandSign emote anime> normal motion",
      "viewerReactions": null
