      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5baa1068e0b68928323f5213|full_name}: It's possible for someone to do that with a hand gesture using the Final IK script already, but only if they have Final IK themselves. The only problem is Final IK itself is $90 on the Asset Store. Having this feature would be better than someone setting it up themselves, and buying Final IK themselves.",
